::Pylint Purpose::  
What is the main purpose of Pylint?  
{  
~ To run Python programs faster  
~ To install and manage Python packages  
= To perform static code analysis and detect code quality issues  
~ To format code automatically  
}

::Static Code Analysis::  
True or False: Static code analysis with Pylint executes the code to find errors.  
{  
~ T    
= F
}

::Running Pylint::  
Which command correctly runs Pylint on a file named `example.py`?  
{  
~ pip install pylint example.py  
= pylint example.py  
~ py -m pylint  
~ python example.py --lint  
}
